00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,379
BBC News reports that the United States launched heavy strikes on Iran after an attempted attack on American troops.

2
00:00:08,329 --> 00:00:14,079
US officials said Iranian ballistic missiles were aimed at forces in Jordan.

3
00:00:14,079 --> 00:00:26,211
The strikes mark another sharp escalation in the regional conflict, raising fears about energy routes, diplomacy and the safety of civilians across the Middle East.

